%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 90a31742b4988d64896200d05b98a005, type: 3}
  m_Name: HitOrMissTermTable
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Entries:
  - key: popup1_intro
    english: 'In this task, a ball will move towards you.  Your task is to decide
      whether the ball will hit or miss you. Respond as quickly and accurately as
      possible.   '
    french: "Dans cette t\xE2che, une balle va se d\xE9placer vers vous. Votre r\xF4le
      est de d\xE9cider si la balle va vous toucher ou vous \xE9viter (manquer).  "
  - key: popup2_triggercheck
    english: 'Trigger check. Please confirm that EEG/EMG triggers are being received
      correctly. '
    french: "V\xE9rification des triggers. Veuillez confirmer que les triggers EEG/EMG
      sont correctement re\xE7us."
  - key: popup3_positioning
    english: Please stand in front of the cross. Face forward and hold both controllers
      comfortably.
    french: Veuillez vous placer devant la croix. Regardez droit devant vous et tenez
      les deux manettes confortablement.
  - key: popup4_controllerpracticeintro
    english: "In this task, you will use the controllers to answer. LEFT means YES,
      the ball will hit me. RIGHT means NO, the ball will miss me. Let\u2019s practice
      the buttons first."
    french: "Dans cette t\xE2che, vous utiliserez les manettes pour r\xE9pondre.
      GAUCHE signifie OUI, la balle va me toucher. DROITE signifie NON, la balle
      va me manquer. Entra\xEEnons-nous d\u2019abord avec les boutons."
  - key: popup5_leftcontrollerpractice
    english: 'Press the LEFT controller for YES. YES means: the ball will hit me.'
    french: 'Appuyez sur la manette GAUCHE pour OUI. OUI signifie : la balle va me
      toucher.'
  - key: popup6_rightcontrollerpractice
    english: 'Press the RIGHT controller for NO. NO means: the ball will miss me. '
    french: 'Appuyez sur la manette DROITE pour NON. NON signifie : la balle va me
      manquer.'
  - key: popup7_balldemointro
    english: During the task, a ball will travel toward you. Your task is to indicate
      whether the ball will hit you or miss you. If the ball hits you, you will see
      a splash. If the ball misses you, it will continue moving past you. First,
      you will watch two examples. You do not need to press anything yet.Just watch
      what happens.
    french: "Pendant la t\xE2che, une balle va se d\xE9placer vers vous. Votre t\xE2che
      consiste \xE0 indiquer si la balle va vous toucher ou vous manquer. Si la balle
      vous touche, vous verrez une \xE9claboussure. Si la balle vous manque, elle
      continuera sa trajectoire derri\xE8re vous. Tout d\u2019abord, vous allez regarder
      deux exemples. Vous n\u2019avez encore besoin d\u2019appuyer sur rien. Regardez
      simplement ce qu\u2019il se passe. "
  - key: popup8_easypractice
    english: 'Now it is your turn. You will first practice with easy examples. After
      each ball, answer:  Will the ball hit you? LEFT = YES, it will hit me. RIGHT
      = NO, it will miss me.'
    french: "Maintenant, c\u2019est \xE0 votre tour. Vous allez d\u2019abord vous
      entra\xEEner avec des exemples faciles. Apr\xE8s chaque balle, r\xE9pondez
      : La balle va-t-elle vous toucher ? GAUCHE = OUI, elle va me toucher. DROITE
      = NON, elle va me manquer."
  - key: popup9_difficult
    english: Good! Now the task will become slightly harder. Some balls will clearly
      hit or miss you. Others will pass very close to your body. Keep answering as
      quickly and accurately as possible.
    french: "Bien ! Maintenant, la t\xE2che va devenir un peu plus difficile. Certaines
      balles vont clairement vous toucher ou vous manquer. D\u2019autres passeront
      tr\xE8s pr\xE8s de votre corps. Continuez \xE0 r\xE9pondre aussi vite et pr\xE9cis\xE9ment
      que possible."
  - key: popup10_practiceretry
    english: "Let\u2019s try the practice again. Try to respond before the ball reaches
      you."
    french: "Recommen\xE7ons l\u2019entra\xEEnement. Essayez de r\xE9pondre avant
      que la balle ne vous atteigne."
  - key: popup11_tooslow
    english: 'Too Slow! '
    french: Trop lent !
  - key: popup12_nofeedback
    english: Practice is now complete. The real task will now begin. During the real
      task, you will no longer receive feedback. The screen will not flash green
      or red, and you will not be told whether your response was correct or incorrect.
    french: "L\u2019entra\xEEnement est maintenant termin\xE9. La t\xE2che r\xE9elle
      va commencer. Pendant la t\xE2che r\xE9elle, vous ne recevrez plus de commentaires.
      L\u2019\xE9cran ne clignotera plus en vert ou en rouge, et on ne vous dira
      plus si votre r\xE9ponse \xE9tait correcte ou incorrecte."
  - key: popup13_ready
    english: Are you ready to begin? Press Start when you are ready.
    french: "\xCAtes-vous pr\xEAt \xE0 commencer ? Appuyez sur Start quand vous \xEAtes
      pr\xEAt."
  - key: popup14_block_intro
    english: Let's start with Block {block}. Press Begin when you are ready.
    french: "Commen\xE7ons avec le Bloc {block}. Appuyez sur Commencer quand vous
      \xEAtes pr\xEAt"
  - key: popup15_break
    english: All done with Block {block}. Take a little break.
    french: "Bloc {block} termin\xE9. Prenez une petite pause."
  - key: popup16_next_block
    english: Are you ready to start with Block {block}? Let's go!
    french: "Pr\xEAt(e) \xE0 commencer le Bloc {block} ? Allons-y !"
  - key: popup17_outro
    english: You are all done. Thank you for your participation.
    french: "C'est termin\xE9. Merci pour votre participation."
  - key: say_hit
    english: HIT
    french: TOUCHE
  - key: say_miss
    english: MISS
    french: "RAT\xC9"
